  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra unders&#xf6;kande journalistik i Ba</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-Study Improving Investigative Journalism in   Bangladesh - Pre-Study Improving Investigative Journalism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Dhaka ger ett planeringsbidrag till FOJO i syfte att under 2015 genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie om mediasituationen och m&#xf6;jligheterna att st&#xf6;dja unders&#xf6;kande journalistik i Bangladesh. Arbetet ska p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjas i september och vara avslutat till 30 november 2015.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Dhaka gives a planning grant to FOJO: Media Institute with the purpose to conduct during 2015 a pre-study study on the media situation and the possibilities to support investigative journalism in Bangladesh. The work will commence in September and be completed by 30 November 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
